# ESLint & Code Quality

- Zero lint warnings/errors in code you touch — do not leave “fix later”
- Remove unused imports, variables, and type imports
- Prefix unused callback args with `_` only when the signature requires them
- Honor `react-hooks/exhaustive-deps`; disable only to avoid loops, with a one-line why
- Run `pnpm lint` / `pnpm typecheck` when finishing a task or via `/check-and-commit` — not after every small edit
